## Natural Emerald Cut Eternity Band Prices

Natural eternity bands use H-I color and SI1-SI2 clarity stones. That grade range is lower than the lab alternative by two steps on color and one on clarity. The step-cut tables of each emerald cut stone in a natural eternity band will show more color warmth than an F-G lab band — this matters more in yellow or rose gold than in white metal.

