Three metals at the same price is the pattern across bezel bands — white gold, yellow gold, and rose gold cost identically at each carat weight. Platinum adds a small premium and is available in lab versions of the bezel design at some carat weights. The price difference between lab bezel and natural bezel at the same carat weight is narrower than most buyers expect: for a 2ct bezel, natural runs $4,070 versus lab bezel at $4,590 (on sale from $6,120).

At 2ct total weight, the natural is actually cheaper — even with the lab sale — because the individual stones are small enough that natural rarity pricing is minimal.

